WEBVTT

01:40.820 --> 01:45.620
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.270 --> 01:50.800
[Episode 33]

02:20.910 --> 02:22.750
Yitan, don't!

02:43.120 --> 02:46.090
I said

02:47.490 --> 02:49.829
I would protect everyone.

02:53.340 --> 02:56.030
But I can't do it anymore.

02:58.120 --> 02:59.680
However...

03:19.030 --> 03:20.590
I...

03:23.710 --> 03:25.560
can still protect you.

03:34.000 --> 03:35.560
Dream,

03:36.410 --> 03:37.850
activate.

03:58.340 --> 03:59.720
Yitan,

04:13.240 --> 04:17.190
I've always been playful and willful since I was little,

04:18.070 --> 04:19.910
but even then,

04:20.160 --> 04:20.950
I knew

04:22.390 --> 04:23.600
I liked you

04:25.150 --> 04:26.540
and the Mask Group.

04:27.930 --> 04:28.690
You guys

04:30.070 --> 04:31.870
mean more to me than my own life.

04:34.830 --> 04:38.120
So no matter how dark the world gets,

04:38.670 --> 04:39.870
I'm not afraid.

04:41.360 --> 04:42.120
Because

04:43.070 --> 04:44.040
we have love.

04:44.740 --> 04:45.510
Right?

04:53.590 --> 04:54.790
Do you remember this?

04:57.530 --> 04:59.300
We promised each other

04:59.560 --> 05:01.070
to stay together for life,

05:02.040 --> 05:03.160
never to be apart.

05:27.320 --> 05:29.610
♪ Moonlight paints the ground silver white ♪

05:30.590 --> 05:32.760
♪ Yet some stubborn soul holds it tight ♪

05:34.220 --> 05:36.400
♪ Mistaking it for the deepest sorrow ♪

05:37.330 --> 05:38.740
♪ That never fades ♪

05:40.600 --> 05:43.000
♪ Barren or bright, it's just the sea of the heart ♪

05:44.140 --> 05:47.960
♪ Love fades and blooms and starts again ♪

05:44.680 --> 05:45.810
Yitan,

05:47.240 --> 05:48.970
you're not allowed to leave me.

05:49.750 --> 05:52.090
♪ How many people can understand it? ♪

05:51.690 --> 05:53.790
So could you promise me one thing?

05:52.950 --> 05:55.630
♪ Flowers blossom and wither, again and again ♪

05:56.360 --> 05:58.860
♪ Like meeting once more, only to part again ♪

05:57.340 --> 05:58.070
Let's...

05:59.530 --> 06:01.110
♪ Time has already changed ♪

05:59.810 --> 06:01.130
find...

06:02.080 --> 06:03.930
the real Yang Yitan together,

06:02.080 --> 06:06.910
♪ Yet we promise to wait ♪

06:04.700 --> 06:05.630
okay?

06:09.630 --> 06:14.720
♪ Splitting the heart, offering love to the raging flames ♪

06:16.180 --> 06:21.420
♪ Tears become the wind, stirring the world into daylight ♪

06:22.420 --> 06:23.890
♪ Don't look back, keep walking ♪

06:24.670 --> 06:25.830
♪ Live or die, keep moving forward ♪

06:26.490 --> 06:28.070
♪ Through the fire ♪

06:29.220 --> 06:31.930
♪ Whose love ♪

06:33.100 --> 06:35.330
♪ Could be wider than the universe? ♪

06:34.310 --> 06:35.360
My name is Wangquan Zui.

06:35.360 --> 06:36.020
From now on,

06:36.040 --> 06:38.620
♪ It's ours ♪

06:36.159 --> 06:37.690
Yitan will be under my care.

06:39.630 --> 06:40.560
Our Zui

06:40.580 --> 06:42.510
deserves all the love in the world.

06:46.470 --> 06:47.460
Between my life

06:48.140 --> 06:49.130
and Zui's,

06:49.750 --> 06:51.020
there's no need to hesitate.

06:50.650 --> 06:53.050
♪ Barren or bright, it's just the sea of the heart ♪

06:52.080 --> 06:53.100
I choose hers.

06:54.190 --> 06:57.810
♪ Love fades and blooms and starts again ♪

06:54.320 --> 06:57.570
You love me more than you love yourself.

06:58.280 --> 06:59.230
Yitan,

06:59.750 --> 07:01.190
is this how you really feel for me?

06:59.800 --> 07:01.950
♪ How many people can understand it? ♪

07:03.000 --> 07:05.310
♪ How time flies ♪

07:04.200 --> 07:06.830
Yitan, I like you!

07:06.410 --> 07:08.570
♪ Mortals are like dust in the world ♪

07:09.580 --> 07:11.160
♪ It's all like a dream in retrospect ♪

07:10.310 --> 07:12.560
No matter what happens in the future,

07:12.130 --> 07:15.130
♪ Nothing can change our minds ♪

07:13.680 --> 07:16.420
I have the confidence to face it with you.

07:16.350 --> 07:21.380
♪ Splitting the heart, offering love to the raging flames ♪

07:16.630 --> 07:20.180
Even if we only have a year,

07:20.240 --> 07:22.040
a month, or a day together,

07:22.950 --> 07:28.060
♪ Tears become the wind, stirring the world into daylight ♪

07:23.470 --> 07:25.950
I just want to spend it with you.

07:29.190 --> 07:30.660
♪ Don't look back, keep walking ♪

07:31.440 --> 07:32.490
♪ Live or die, keep moving forward ♪

07:33.260 --> 07:34.840
♪ Through the fire ♪

07:35.990 --> 07:38.630
♪ Whose love ♪

07:39.870 --> 07:41.990
♪ Could be wider than the universe? ♪

07:42.570 --> 07:47.150
♪ It's ours ♪

07:43.310 --> 07:44.720
December 5th.

07:44.970 --> 07:46.890
Our wedding date remains unchanged.

07:46.890 --> 07:47.950
After we come back,

07:49.420 --> 07:50.630
we'll get married.

07:52.430 --> 07:53.070
Okay.

07:53.870 --> 07:55.680
In this life, you're the only one in my heart,

07:55.680 --> 07:57.560
and that's enough.

07:55.800 --> 07:57.420
♪ Don't look back, keep walking ♪

07:58.290 --> 07:59.460
♪ Live or die, keep moving forward ♪

08:00.100 --> 08:01.890
♪ Through the fire ♪

08:02.640 --> 08:05.380
♪ Whose love ♪

08:06.580 --> 08:08.870
♪ Could be wider than the universe? ♪

08:09.760 --> 08:14.050
♪ It's ours ♪

08:21.130 --> 08:23.240
Go and see what you want to see.

08:57.360 --> 08:58.200
Yitan,

08:59.240 --> 09:00.030
Zui...

09:07.150 --> 09:10.150
The Black Fox has taken control of my Clairvoyant Eye.

09:12.120 --> 09:14.890
She knows all our weaknesses,

09:15.640 --> 09:17.060
and can predict

09:18.080 --> 09:20.710
all your actions.

09:54.750 --> 09:56.000
Hongye,

09:56.720 --> 09:58.360
where are you?

09:59.200 --> 10:01.600
My brother is dead.

10:02.510 --> 10:03.530
Hongye,

10:03.780 --> 10:05.390
you knew the Mask Group's fate

10:05.390 --> 10:07.150
was inevitable, didn't you?

10:07.150 --> 10:08.540
Break the dark night

10:08.570 --> 10:10.060
and destroy the Black Fox?

10:10.790 --> 10:12.030
Wangquan Hongye,

10:12.750 --> 10:14.120
you're truly ridiculous.

10:14.120 --> 10:16.790
Hongye, I hate you!

10:17.750 --> 10:19.950
Hongye, I'll never see Jiuru again.

10:19.970 --> 10:21.450
It's all because of you!

10:21.550 --> 10:23.090
It's all because of you!

10:24.910 --> 10:26.750
Hongye, it hurts.

10:26.750 --> 10:29.510
Hongye, Zui is dead.

10:29.550 --> 10:32.870
Wangquan Hongye, look at your hands.

10:33.630 --> 10:35.640
They are stained with our blood!

10:37.000 --> 10:39.560
Why did you make us come here,

10:39.720 --> 10:41.120
knowing our fate couldn't be changed?

10:41.120 --> 10:44.000
Hongye, I killed Zui!

10:44.420 --> 10:46.030
Why did we come here?

10:46.120 --> 10:47.320
You're the one who got us killed.

10:47.320 --> 10:48.960
Why did you make us come here?

10:49.030 --> 10:50.460
Wangquan Hongye,

10:51.390 --> 10:53.630
you must atone with your death!

10:53.670 --> 10:54.870
Please save my brother!

10:54.870 --> 10:56.360
I'll never see my daughter again!

10:56.360 --> 10:58.510
He died because of you, Hongye!

10:59.320 --> 11:00.750
Why can't you protect anyone?

11:00.750 --> 11:02.700
Why did you come to assassinate me?

11:02.820 --> 11:04.610
Why did you go against fate?

11:04.670 --> 11:06.600
Why did you send us here to die?

11:06.670 --> 11:07.800
You got my brother killed.

11:07.800 --> 11:08.870
You're the Mask Group Leader.

11:08.870 --> 11:10.150
Why are you still alive?

11:10.150 --> 11:13.000
Wangquan Hongye, you've failed us.

11:13.000 --> 11:15.390
The downfall of the Yang family is all because of you.

11:15.390 --> 11:17.010
Why aren't you making a move?

11:17.120 --> 11:19.020
Why are you the only one alive?

11:19.870 --> 11:20.810
Do it.

11:20.910 --> 11:22.270
I got Zui killed.

11:22.270 --> 11:23.930
Go ahead. Do it.

11:24.150 --> 11:25.560
It's all your fault.

11:25.600 --> 11:26.750
Why are you still alive?

11:26.750 --> 11:28.030
We're still together.

11:28.200 --> 11:29.120
Come on, Hongye.

11:29.120 --> 11:30.200
Come on, do it.

11:30.240 --> 11:31.670
Do it, Hongye!

11:33.320 --> 11:34.440
You got everyone killed.

11:34.440 --> 11:35.240
You deserve to die.

11:35.240 --> 11:37.420
It's all your fault, Hongye.

11:38.510 --> 11:40.240
You're the one who got us killed!

11:40.240 --> 11:41.030
Hongye.

11:53.780 --> 11:54.700
Hongye.

11:58.830 --> 12:00.430
The Mask Group...

12:02.920 --> 12:04.470
cannot lose.

12:50.550 --> 12:52.430
The end of this world

12:56.300 --> 12:57.900
is definitely not darkness.

13:28.490 --> 13:29.800
Zui,

13:31.300 --> 13:32.870
I'm coming.

14:25.640 --> 14:27.230
Go to hell!

15:20.640 --> 15:21.440
Here it comes.

15:28.790 --> 15:30.290
Wangquan Hongye,

15:30.710 --> 15:32.740
you're here to rewrite fate again?

15:33.560 --> 15:36.780
You should stay with your Mask Group.

16:35.190 --> 16:38.120
The end for those who were imprisoned by the Black Fox

16:38.280 --> 16:39.340
for a hundred years

16:40.090 --> 16:41.720
shouldn't be eternal night.

16:45.870 --> 16:47.590
As long as we eliminate the Black Fox,

16:47.590 --> 16:49.120
everything can be stopped.

16:49.950 --> 16:50.780
Bumu,

16:51.240 --> 16:53.100
I need the names of all the victims

16:53.240 --> 16:54.630
in this mass grave.

18:29.070 --> 18:30.420
Damn it.

18:37.170 --> 18:39.830
Igniting the Unparalleled Sword with your life?

18:39.830 --> 18:41.780
Do you really want to die?

18:42.290 --> 18:43.730
At this point,

18:45.420 --> 18:48.680
the only choice is to sacrifice myself for righteousness!

20:08.000 --> 20:09.220
Impossible!

20:09.270 --> 20:11.510
How can a human kill me?

20:11.590 --> 20:15.030
How can a mere human possibly kill me?

20:53.070 --> 20:55.200
Love is growing, and hatred is fading.

20:55.790 --> 20:58.250
Since the Grief Tree has already recovered,

20:59.030 --> 21:02.680
the Black Fox's power should have been weakened.

21:04.160 --> 21:06.620
I wonder how Hongye and the others are doing.

21:06.820 --> 21:08.680
You've exhausted your spiritual energy.

21:08.680 --> 21:10.340
I'll take you to Tianmen Pass.

21:11.270 --> 21:11.960
Alright.

21:12.310 --> 21:13.880
Deputy Chief, Miss Dongfang.

21:13.880 --> 21:16.920
Someone from the Divine Fire Villa is here. He's outside the boundary marker.

21:16.920 --> 21:17.960
What's the matter?

21:17.960 --> 21:19.200
He said his name is Dong.

21:19.200 --> 21:20.640
Miss Qinlan told him to tell you

21:20.640 --> 21:24.500
the old master is critically ill. She asks you to return immediately.

21:35.790 --> 21:36.720
Senior Renfeng.

21:43.160 --> 21:44.240
How is my father?

21:44.750 --> 21:45.680
Junior Huaizhu,

21:46.030 --> 21:47.490
you've finally returned.

21:48.160 --> 21:49.830
A few days ago, when Master was practicing,

21:49.830 --> 21:51.830
he lost control of his inner energy.

22:00.200 --> 22:01.350
Junior Huaizhu,

22:01.920 --> 22:04.670
I know how much you care for your father.

22:04.790 --> 22:06.880
Master lost control of his inner energy,

22:06.880 --> 22:09.440
and I'm using my inner energy to sustain his life.

22:09.440 --> 22:12.000
He needs rest now.

22:14.110 --> 22:15.660
Even I can't see him?

22:15.750 --> 22:17.790
Junior Huaizhu, you've been gone for so long.

22:17.790 --> 22:20.990
Why don't you visit Junior Qinlan at Lanzhu Garden first?

22:27.110 --> 22:31.350
Dong, escort Miss Huaizhu back to Lanzhu Garden.

22:34.000 --> 22:35.800
Miss Huaizhu, this way, please.

22:44.430 --> 22:51.690
[Lanzhu Garden]

22:54.110 --> 22:55.110
You may stay here.

22:56.160 --> 22:57.220
Miss Huaizhu, I...

23:14.640 --> 23:15.550
Huaizhu?

23:16.000 --> 23:16.790
Huaizhu!

23:18.350 --> 23:21.000
That scoundrel Jin Renfeng is planning a rebellion.

23:21.000 --> 23:22.720
Let's go and check on Father.

23:23.590 --> 23:24.240
Qinlan,

23:24.920 --> 23:27.030
something major happened in the Divine Fire Villa.

23:27.030 --> 23:29.230
I'll find a way to get you out of here now.

23:30.160 --> 23:30.960
I won't leave.

23:31.830 --> 23:32.550
Qinlan,

23:33.270 --> 23:34.550
you promised me that

23:35.000 --> 23:37.330
in important matters, you'd listen to me.

23:39.440 --> 23:41.200
I'm not leaving you.

23:42.500 --> 23:44.560
You don't want to part with me either.

23:46.480 --> 23:47.280
Miss Huaizhu.

23:48.880 --> 23:49.720
What is it?

23:49.940 --> 23:51.400
Senior Renfeng ordered me

23:51.590 --> 23:53.890
to bring Yuping to serve you two ladies.

23:54.270 --> 23:57.130
You're obviously just sending someone to spy on us!

23:59.720 --> 24:00.720
I see.

24:01.030 --> 24:01.830
Let her stay.

24:02.110 --> 24:02.790
Yes.

24:08.080 --> 24:11.540
[Lanzhu Garden]

24:13.640 --> 24:14.400
You may rise.

24:16.030 --> 24:17.350
You had no choice.

24:18.160 --> 24:20.480
You've been following us for so many years.

24:20.480 --> 24:22.610
I won't make things difficult for you.

24:26.680 --> 24:27.400
Yuping,

24:28.880 --> 24:30.940
is there anything you want to tell me?

24:32.350 --> 24:33.200
Miss Huaizhu,

24:34.160 --> 24:35.110
Jin Renfeng...

24:36.240 --> 24:38.460
Jin Renfeng killed the master.

24:38.680 --> 24:40.350
I saw it with my own eyes.

24:44.400 --> 24:45.390
Senior Renfeng.

24:45.720 --> 24:47.830
Have you done everything as I instructed?

24:47.830 --> 24:49.200
Rest assured, Senior Renfeng.

24:49.200 --> 24:52.330
Over the past few days, I've replaced Master's medicine

24:52.440 --> 24:56.000
with slow-acting poison, just as you ordered.

24:56.750 --> 24:59.310
He definitely won't be able to move tonight.

25:01.920 --> 25:03.520
Clear the area immediately.

25:03.830 --> 25:05.560
Tonight, not a single outsider

25:05.960 --> 25:09.110
is allowed to be here.

25:10.270 --> 25:11.000
Yes.

25:17.740 --> 25:18.950
Master,

25:20.020 --> 25:22.020
Junior Huaizhu has already noticed

25:22.310 --> 25:24.440
that I'm in cahoots with the Black Fox.

25:25.130 --> 25:27.370
She'll definitely purge me from the sect

25:27.370 --> 25:28.650
and kick me out.

25:30.550 --> 25:31.960
All these years,

25:32.830 --> 25:34.430
I've been working like a dog,

25:36.200 --> 25:37.400
but to you,

25:39.350 --> 25:41.030
I've always been just a mutt

25:41.830 --> 25:44.350
you could throw out anytime.

25:46.680 --> 25:48.350
It's unfair.

25:48.640 --> 25:49.640
In terms of looks

25:50.310 --> 25:51.540
and talent,

25:52.850 --> 25:55.780
how am I inferior to Wangquan Hongye?

25:58.160 --> 26:01.120
My only disadvantage is my background.

26:02.880 --> 26:03.590
Master,

26:05.000 --> 26:07.460
you're not going to live much longer anyway.

26:07.830 --> 26:08.790
Why don't you give me the blood in your body

26:08.790 --> 26:11.570
that controls the Pure Yang Flame

26:13.030 --> 26:15.890
and let me become the true Fire God?

27:18.310 --> 27:20.060
With your blood,

27:21.200 --> 27:24.460
the power of the Divine Fire will be completely different.

27:34.210 --> 27:36.480
Master, don't worry.

27:37.090 --> 27:39.020
I have already replaced your blood

27:39.400 --> 27:41.080
with mine.

27:42.240 --> 27:44.030
No one will notice.

27:48.570 --> 27:49.890
Oh right, Master.

27:50.470 --> 27:52.670
I also plan to marry both Junior Sisters

27:53.680 --> 27:55.200
to make full use

27:55.840 --> 27:59.170
of the other secret hidden in the Dongfang Spiritual Blood.

28:03.380 --> 28:04.770
Do you hate me?

28:07.990 --> 28:09.190
It's useless.

28:10.620 --> 28:12.580
I told you a long time ago

28:14.750 --> 28:16.070
that they are mine.

28:38.110 --> 28:40.310
You saw my father die with your own eyes?

28:41.000 --> 28:42.350
I saw the old master

28:43.240 --> 28:45.240
close his eyes with my own eyes.

28:50.070 --> 28:51.440
Jin Renfeng!

28:52.830 --> 28:54.750
Go to hell!

28:57.350 --> 28:58.070
Qinlan.

28:59.920 --> 29:02.370
He has now mastered the Pure Yang Flame.

29:04.030 --> 29:06.530
I've exhausted all my spiritual energy.

29:13.400 --> 29:15.030
We are no match for him.

29:16.200 --> 29:18.000
There are lots of outsiders in the villa.

29:18.000 --> 29:20.260
They're all Senior Renfeng's henchmen.

29:22.270 --> 29:23.680
I don't care.

29:23.960 --> 29:26.030
He must die!

29:34.580 --> 29:35.550
Yuping.

29:37.680 --> 29:38.920
Go and tell Dong

29:42.880 --> 29:43.960
that Qinlan is ill.

29:45.790 --> 29:46.720
Okay.
